{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1552383-looking-for-old-3e-core-backer-rewards","id":1552383,"title":"Looking for old 3e core backer rewards","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-07-14T11:57:51-07:00","id":1552383,"title":"Looking for old 3e core backer rewards","content":"So I haven't visited the forums since the hard copy of the 3rd core got delivered, when backer rewards for the core still were not complete, and the backer updates were mostly just advertisements for other products instead of actual updates on projects from the core kickstarter.<br /> <br /> I see that the updates to the kickstarter page ended a few years ago, but I can't seem to see updates about the novel by Jess Hartley or the Abyssal and Infernal previews.<br /> <br /> I did find the Aaron Rosenburg novel, in a &quot;backers only&quot; post, but the second music suite only had a message saying it was in an email link. spam mail doesn't last that long and the post says to message the creator, but does &quot;contact the creator&quot; even work? I see the newer projects use backerkit instead of kickstarter so does Richard Thomas even manage that account anymore?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2817-phantom-queen","name":"Phantom Queen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2817_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-07-15T00:22:00-07:00","id":1552404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phantom Queen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1552383-looking-for-old-3e-core-backer-rewards#post1552383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I haven't visited the forums since the hard copy of the 3rd core got delivered, when backer rewards for the core still were not complete, and the backer updates were mostly just advertisements for other products instead of actual updates on projects from the core kickstarter.<br /> <br /> I see that the updates to the kickstarter page ended a few years ago, but I can't seem to see updates about the novel by Jess Hartley or the Abyssal and Infernal previews.<br /> <br /> I did find the Aaron Rosenburg novel, in a &quot;backers only&quot; post, but the second music suite only had a message saying it was in an email link. spam mail doesn't last that long and the post says to message the creator, but does &quot;contact the creator&quot; even work? I see the newer projects use backerkit instead of kickstarter so does Richard Thomas even manage that account anymore?</div> </div> </div> </div>Onyx Path still use Kickstarter, it's just no longer their sole crowdfunding platform. Rich's KS account is still active - the last project he used it for was Onyx Path's Curseborne last year. However, if you message it now it'll go to James Bell, OPP's crowdfunder concierge. The 3e core was before his time, but it might be worth a try.<br /> <br /> The previews have long since been taken down, but some people have hung on to them (PM me about that for more). The actual Abyssals book is currently being errata'd before release, and Infernals is in drafts - neither went quite the way of the previews, not least because there was a change in devs.<br /> <br /> As regards the Hartley novel: Update #94 mentions she had to drop out for personal reasons, and Rosenberg and Roy ended up taking over, so there's no novel from her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}